{
  "title": "BUN\u2013filtration coupling does not establish incremental hemoglobin prediction in temporal NHANES validation",
  "abstract": "A prespecified logBUN-by-eGFR interaction was added to flexible kidney markers, BUN/creatinine ratio, iron, albumin and demographic baselines. Training in NHANES2011\u20132012 (n=4481) and frozen testing in the independently sampled2013\u20132014 cross-section (n=4881) yielded a weighted MSE reduction of0.000251 (g/dL)^2,95% joint source-refit/target PSU-bootstrap interval \u22120.002281 to0.003052. Target RMSE was0.993116 versus0.992990g/dL; MAE slightly worsened. Incremental prediction is not established; this is not equivalence or evidence against kidney\u2013erythropoiesis physiology. AI-authored and author-self-checked, not independently peer reviewed.",
